    "about.powered_by": "Dikuasakan oleh",
    "about.privacy_body": "WCC is built for local \/ on-prem installs. It does not phone home, and it does not collect your plant data for anyone else. Tickets, assets, users, and files live in your database on your host. How safe that is depends on your own network, firewall, accounts, and backups — not on a cloud we control, because there isn’t one.",
    "about.privacy_title": "Runs on your machine — your data stays yours",
    "about.release_intro": "Open beta OB1.0.0 — the modules below are built, wired end to end, and exercised on plant-style data. Expect polish as the beta matures.",
    "about.send_email": "Send an email",
    "about.unified_by": "Disatukan oleh",
    "about.view_license": "Lihat lesen",
    "about.welcome": "Selamat datang ke Workshop Control Center (WCC). Ini bukan sekadar perisian enterprise gendut yang direka di bilik mesyuarat—ia adalah CMMS berprestasi tinggi tanpa rangka kerja yang ditempa terus di lantai kilang. Dibina oleh juruteknik dan jurutera, UNTUK juruteknik dan jurutera, WCC membuang beban korporat untuk menyampaikan apa yang benar-benar penting: kelajuan pelaksanaan mutlak. Direka untuk beroperasi di edge, ia memecahkan penahanan maklumat, meletakkan alatan untuk mengurus kitaran tiket lengkap, menjejaki inventori penting, dan menganalisis KPI masa nyata terus di tangan anda.",
    "about.whats_in": "Apa dalam :version (:codename)",
